ly bars warm up indicators; the next half initializes training, then three expanding-train / disjoint-test folds run chronologically.","All returns, win rate, drawdown and expectancy use percentage points; profit factor is a ratio. Expectancy is mean net trade return. Undefined win rate, profit factor or expectancy is null.","Equity, trade statistics, totalReturn and testReturn cover only concatenated nonoverlapping test folds. trainReturn is the arithmetic mean of overlapping expanding-training fold returns, never their sum.","Decisions use close t and only 4H candles closed by t; entries and signal exits use open t+1. Fee 10 bps plus adverse slippage 5 bps on each side. One unlevered position, all available cash, fractional quantities; exchange lot/tick rounding and capacity are not modeled.","Known opening stop/target events resolve before later intrabar extremes. Otherwise stop-first for ambiguous OHLC; gap-through stops use the worse open, while favorable target gaps fill at the fixed target. No target fill on an entry bar. Stops remain active. Maximum hold 72 hours; predeclared fold boundaries flatten at the final bar open with both exit costs.","Drawdown uses hourly equity including estimated liquidation costs, not an intrabar worst-case path. No fees for idle cash, funding, shorting, leverage, tax or liquidity impact beyond fixed slippage.","Degradation and low-sample flags are descriptive; these short, single-symbol folds do not prove robustness, eliminate overfitting, or estimate a probability of future profit.","EMA 21/50 + RSI momentum, fold 1: training 2026-10-20T18:00:00.000Z to 2026-11-06T09:59:59.999Z, 8 trades, -1.152%; test 2026-11-06T10:00:00.000Z to 2026-11-11T22:59:59.999Z, 0 trades, 0.000% net.","EMA 21/50 + RSI momentum, fold 2: training 2026-10-20T18:00:00.000Z to 2026-11-11T22:59:59.999Z, 8 trades, -1.152%; test 2026-11-11T23:00:00.000Z to 2026-11-17T11:59:59.999Z, 0 trades, 0.000% net.","EMA 21/50 + RSI momentum, fold 3: training 2026-10-20